{
  "id": "1SA.23",
  "number": "23",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Sam 23",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwabikwa kuDavida kwathiwa: AmaFilistiya ahlasela iKeyila, aphanga lezibuya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasebuza eNkosini uNkulunkulu esithi: Ngiye ukulwa lamaFilistiya na? INkosi yathi kuye: Hamba uyekulwa lawo, usize iKeyila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa abantu bakaDavida bathi kuye: Khangela, siyesaba khonapha koJuda; phoke, kuzakuba njani uba sisiya eKeyila, silwe lezimpi zamaFilistiya na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasebuza futhi eNkosini. INkosi yamphendula yathi: Suka uye eKeyila; ngoba ngizawanikela amaFilistiya esandleni sakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida labantu bakhe baya eKeyila, balwa lamaFilistiya, bathumba inkomo zawo, babulala amanengi. Wabakhulula uDavida abaseKeyila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lapho uAbiyatha, indodana kaAhimeleki ebalekela kuDavida eKeyila, wafika ephethe ingubo yamahlombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwabikwa kuSawuli ukuthi uDavida ungenile eKeyila. USawuli wathi: UNkulunkulu umnikele esandleni sami; ngoba uzivalele ngokungena emzini olamasango lemigoqo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wasebiza bonke abantu ukuba bayehlasela iKeyila, bavimbezele uDavida labantu bakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wezwa ukuba uSawuli wenza icebo elibi ngaye; wathi kuAbiyatha umpristi: Letha lapha ingubo yamahlombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasesithi: Nkosi, Nkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, inceku yakho izwile impela ukuba uSawuli ufuna ukuza eKeyila ukuba alichithe ngenxa yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baseKeyila bazanginikela kuye na? Uzafika uSawuli njengokuzwa kwenceku yakho na? Nkosi, Nkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, akuyitshele inceku yakho. INkosi yamphendula yathi: Uzafika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasesithi: Abantu baseKeyila bazanginikela mina labantu bami kuSawuli na? INkosi yathi: Bazakulinikela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesuka uDavida labantu bakhe ababengamakhulu ayisithupha, baphuma eKeyila, baya lapho ababengaya khona. Lapho uSawuli esetshelwa ukuthi uDavida usebalekile eKeyila, waseyekela ukuphuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wahlala enkangala ezinqabeni, ezintabeni ezisenkangala yaseZifi. USawuli wayemdinga insuku zonke, kodwa uNkulunkulu kamnikelanga esandleni sakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wayesesaba ngoba uSawuli wayephumele ukumbulala. UDavida wayeseHoreshi enkangala yaseZifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJonathani, indodana kaSawuli, wasuka waya kuDavida, wammisa isibindi ngebizo likaNkulunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kuye: Ungesabi, isandla sikaSawuli ubaba kasiyikukuthinta. Uzakuba yinkosi koIsrayeli, mina ngikulandele esikhundleni; lobaba uyakwazi lokho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebesenza isivumelwano bobabili phambi kweNkosi; uDavida wahlala eHoreshi, uJonathani wabuyela ekhaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.18.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 18:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbaseZifi basuka baya kuSawuli eGibeya bathi: Sizwile ukuthi uDavida ucatshile kithi ezinqabeni zaseHoreshi, entabeni yaseHakila engaseningizimu kwaseJeshimoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke woza, nkosi, uba kuyisifiso senhliziyo yakho ukuza; thina sizamnikela esandleni sakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wathi: INkosi ilibusise ngoba lingizwele isihawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hambani, lihlolisise, liyibone impela indawo lapho akhona, lokuthi ubonwe ngubani lapho, ngoba ngitsheliwe ukuba ulobuqili impela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dingani, lizazi zonke indawo lapho acatsha khona, libuyeke kimi selileqiniso. Ngizahambake lani; kuthike nxa ekhona elizweni, ngimdinge phakathi kwazo zonke inkulungwane zabantu bakoJuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebesukake besiya eZifi phambi kukaSawuli. UDavida labantu bakhe babesenkangala yaseMahoni, eAraba, ngeningizimu kweJeshimoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli labantu bakhe bayamdinga. UDavida wakuzwa lokhu, waya eliweni elisenkangala yaseMahoni. Kwathi uSawuli esekwazile, waxotshana laye enkangala yaseMahoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wahamba ngakolunye uhlangothi lwentaba, uDavida labantu bakhe bahamba ngakolunye. Kwathi uDavida esabaleka, loSawuli labantu bakhe besahanqa uDavida labantu bakhe, sebesondela ukuba bababambe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwafika isithunywa kuSawuli sathi: Phangisa ubuye, ngoba amaFilistiya asengenile elizweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasebuya uSawuli ekuxotsheni uDavida, wayakulwa lamaFilistiya. Ngakhoke basebeyibiza leyondawo bathi liDwala lokwahlukanisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasesuka lapho, wayahlala ezinqabeni zaseEngedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
